		{"id":"linux-header","type":"text","text":"# Linux path\n\nWeb enumeration is often the entry point. Turn a supported finding into execution, obtain a stable shell, then enumerate locally for root.","x":-1800,"y":120,"width":620,"height":150,"color":"4"},
